z6Ilh95GRvxOxnXv3vA&oe=6B008808"}, "display_name": "Symphoni", "keywords": ["Conducting", "Maestro", "Wizard", "Magic", "Rhythm"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udd95 April Update | PLAY & CREATE Custom Songs with Symphoni Composer (Beta)\n**Community-made symphonies** are now available with **mod.io** integration + **Symphoni Composer** (Beta). Check out our community library here: https://mod.io/g/symphoni\n{707255111657422}\n\n# \ud83c\udf0e Step Into Magical Realms\n{921407033308625}\n\n# \ud83c\udf20 Wield the Power of Music\n{1017135330244800}{633925752354407}\n\n# \ud83d\udd2e Collect Wands & Unlock Crystals\n{2753157158218964}{602916329194974}\n\n# \ud83e\ude84 Master the Magic of Motion\n{1132195501699773}{664540836007804}\n\n# \u2728 Experience the Magic of Music\nJoin our Discord for exclusive updates: https://discord.gg/symphoni\n{1043215534309263}", "short_description": "Welcome to Symphoni, where you can be a grand musical wizard who breathes new life into classical music. Unlike traditional rhythm games, Symphoni lets you conduct, cast spells, and transform reality while grooving to the classics.\n\nWith 16 masterpieces, 3 difficulties, wand collection, collectible crystals, a community map library, and free song updates planned in the near future, get ready to raise your wand and experience the magic of classical music like never before."}]}, "developer_name": "techToy Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://techtoy.studio/symphoni-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://techtoy.studio/tos/", "publisher_name": "techToy Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://symphoni.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_